ency and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7ON_VmBZy1IQ7kNvwFew0GM&_nc_oc=AdrgknSAj7IPtVcYNsCE4n_Pg6ewej1k69PFN9GHnQC3zH-C65IgGC9RDpoQ3jMGSWs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4CUPDF5Y1WmrhzxEWjdeyD1t1Il88PbQlMJ_NaV4pHdw&oe=6A047D39"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0ZJDcCDoV1YQ7kNvwGYWD_t&_nc_oc=AdpHgfTf1vRxB65XdzgbyLppYDddlB1_Zvl4BC39PWGCN89zMfB_MszYic1aeUrpLGQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7BdqES0VoHm_dMiTDYWLcxMrjYKybd6jMHOVLbLBk_IQ&oe=6A046B8F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pmT5_62faOUQ7kNvwEu5ll1&_nc_oc=AdqbjHR9ovfvtJozq6d8AcJ3rGnVE5vcWmpqu6zW_qNpBhwrS8PNdkf2htsE3HZQxkw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6Rl5g6VWlrQZibg_2nZwmJjX8q-jwBhbra0-WCtY_Uog&oe=6A04796E"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squa